0 HEAD
1 SOUR genimerge
2 NAME exports/post-merge/hotfix-romer-ingrid-parentage.ged
1 NOTE HOTFIX 2026-09-21 -- the Roemer join. Asserted by Wikidata, absent from our tree.
2 CONT
2 CONT WHAT WIKIDATA ALREADY SAYS. Q141290200 "Ingrid Oelversdatter Smoer", b.1329 d.1393, alias
2 CONT "Ingrid Oelversdatter Roemer", carries P22 = Q141450322. The ledger pairs that QID with
2 CONT geni 6000000002621242041, Oelver Henningsson Roemer. So the father edge is published; it is
2 CONT only our tree that lacks it.
2 CONT
2 CONT WHAT OUR TREE HAS. Ingrid appears twice and BOTH are the owner's ancestors:
2 CONT   6000000002893346298  carries FAMC @F6000000036740813161@ -- a family with a CHIL line and
2 CONT                        NOTHING ELSE. Identical in all 13 privileged files that hold it, so
2 CONT                        it is the settled state and not an artifact of one export.
2 CONT   6000000225709965832  father recorded as 6000000227289508960, the HUSK, which redirects to
2 CONT                        6000000002621242041 and carries no ancestry of its own.
2 CONT Between them the owner reaches Oelver only through a dead redirect, so the priority ancestor
2 CONT ring seeded on Q141450322 has grown 1,278 people that reach nobody.
2 CONT
2 CONT WHAT THIS FILE DOES. It puts a HUSB on the family that ALREADY EXISTS and already holds her
2 CONT as CHIL. No new FAM xref is invented and no FAMC is added, because both are already there.
2 CONT No mother is asserted: the evidence is the patronymic, which names the father and is silent
2 CONT on the mother. The second profile is left alone rather than pointed at the same family --
2 CONT the duplicate is a separate defect and merging it here would hide it.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nothing here touched geni.com. The moratorium of 2026-09-21 is intact.
1 GEDC
2 VERS 5.5.1
2 FORM LINEAGE-LINKED
